WEBVTT

00:43.585 --> 00:48.423
DOONA!

01:05.607 --> 01:07.358
Pull away if you don't like it.

01:49.776 --> 01:54.948
EPISODE 4
THE UNEXPECTED

02:01.746 --> 02:06.626
WATER FILTRATION PLANT PLANNING
FILTRATION TARGET PARTICULATE MATTER

02:24.310 --> 02:27.647
Sorry, the number you're trying to reach
is currently unavailable.

02:27.730 --> 02:29.440
Please try again later.

03:11.816 --> 03:13.443
When do you have lunch?

03:14.027 --> 03:16.237
Oh, I don't think I'll have time
to have lunch.

03:16.321 --> 03:17.155
Really?

03:18.740 --> 03:19.657
That's a bummer.

03:20.658 --> 03:21.784
I'm sorry.

03:23.453 --> 03:25.079
Why are you sorry all the time?

03:26.873 --> 03:30.960
Look, don't worry about me.
I didn't come here to see you.

03:32.128 --> 03:34.005
I'm very capable of having fun by myself.

03:45.975 --> 03:49.270
We're almost all set. All passengers,
please pull the safety bar

03:49.354 --> 03:53.816
all the way down to your waist
until it clicks.

04:08.581 --> 04:10.959
This is no fun, no fun at all.

04:55.420 --> 04:56.379
Are you done?

05:11.519 --> 05:13.354
You're really enjoying that, aren't you?

05:14.022 --> 05:16.107
I haven't been able to eat all day.

05:23.406 --> 05:24.449
When was it?

05:27.076 --> 05:29.412
A show got canceled due to the weather.

05:30.371 --> 05:34.375
Getting that free time was
like a gift to me,

05:35.710 --> 05:37.712
so I really wanted to do something.

05:38.212 --> 05:40.131
But I couldn't think of anything,

05:42.425 --> 05:43.843
despite desperately wanting to.

05:44.969 --> 05:47.430
That's when I realized that

05:48.431 --> 05:50.683
apart from singing and dancing,

05:51.684 --> 05:53.436
there's nothing that I know how to do.

05:59.067 --> 06:00.401
I thought, "Later,

06:01.527 --> 06:02.612
much later,

06:03.988 --> 06:06.824
when I lose the ability to sing or dance

06:07.992 --> 06:11.746
and end up with a lot of time on my hands,
what do I do then?"

06:13.289 --> 06:14.248
"I'll be bored

06:15.249 --> 06:16.209
and lonely."

06:17.794 --> 06:19.170
"Life would be no fun at all."

06:23.883 --> 06:24.717
But actually,

06:26.052 --> 06:27.720
it's more fun than I thought.

06:28.346 --> 06:29.597
It's become more fun.

06:31.015 --> 06:31.849
That's good.

06:36.145 --> 06:37.397
KOREAN HISTORY, TOEIC MASTERY,
WATER ENGINEERING

06:37.480 --> 06:38.314
How about you?

06:39.690 --> 06:40.817
What do you want to do?

06:40.900 --> 06:43.653
I'm assuming
it wasn't your dream simply to work hard.

06:47.490 --> 06:51.160
Here I am, eating jajangmyeon with you
at 11 p.m. I count that as a win.

06:54.747 --> 06:58.668
Just living an ordinary life
like everyone else. That's my dream.

07:00.336 --> 07:01.921
For me, even that's an achievement.

07:12.098 --> 07:13.266
Shall we give these a go?

07:18.980 --> 07:20.815
Let's hope we have luck on our side.

07:34.245 --> 07:37.665
Wait, aren't these supposed to have
only positive things on them?

07:38.249 --> 07:39.917
- Who made these?
- What does it say?

07:40.001 --> 07:42.253
"You will face your enemy
at the worst moment."

07:42.336 --> 07:44.547
"You'll be as helpless as a mouse
before a cat."

07:45.756 --> 07:46.841
Are you the mouse?

07:48.259 --> 07:52.638
"Prepare for the unexpected.
Or the consequences could be dire."

07:52.722 --> 07:56.601
I was trying to lighten your mood,
but it's been an utter failure.

07:57.518 --> 08:01.189
It doesn't bother me
since I'm not the type to make enemies.

08:02.064 --> 08:02.899
That's true.

08:06.486 --> 08:07.862
And I'm in a good mood anyway.

08:10.907 --> 08:12.658
This jajangmyeon is so good.

08:14.911 --> 08:15.786
Also true.

08:21.000 --> 08:23.753
- Let's have another date sometime.
- When?

08:24.337 --> 08:28.466
When the weather is so freaking amazing
that we won't be able to stay indoors.

08:36.307 --> 08:37.558
This is so good!

08:43.314 --> 08:45.191
- Won-jun.
- Yeah?

08:46.526 --> 08:48.319
Don't always work so hard.

08:51.155 --> 08:54.033
You're allowed
to take it easy occasionally.

08:55.493 --> 08:56.327
Like me.

08:58.204 --> 09:00.957
Cut corners, slack off…

09:02.583 --> 09:03.459
Who cares?

09:07.964 --> 09:08.798
What?

09:10.216 --> 09:11.217
I do.

09:11.926 --> 09:13.719
I sometimes have really evil thoughts.

09:15.263 --> 09:16.681
When I left home,

09:17.348 --> 09:19.016
I left behind my sick sister

09:19.725 --> 09:21.936
and my mom who works
as the sole breadwinner.

09:22.520 --> 09:24.480
You'd expect me to leave
with a heavy heart.

09:26.440 --> 09:27.525
But actually,

09:28.734 --> 09:32.196
I felt a little happy. Just momentarily.

09:33.823 --> 09:35.408
Is that an evil thought?

09:37.618 --> 09:38.661
Of course it is.

09:39.662 --> 09:42.415
It's so evil
that I've never even talked about it.

09:43.833 --> 09:45.209
This is the first time.

09:57.305 --> 10:00.182
What? Why are you laughing?

10:05.855 --> 10:08.482
- Why are you laughing?
- Seriously.

10:08.983 --> 10:10.818
Why are you laughing?

10:12.153 --> 10:15.114
- I'm not telling you.
- Come on, what is it? Tell me.

10:15.615 --> 10:17.158
Oh, you're so funny!

11:09.001 --> 11:12.213
TIME TO MOVE ON FROM
YOUR PAST RELATIONSHIP AND START ANEW!

11:12.296 --> 11:14.799
SEIZE EVERY OPPORTUNITY
TO CHANGE YOUR FATE

11:22.056 --> 11:23.766
What? Face an enemy?

11:24.350 --> 11:25.935
You don't have any enemies.

11:26.018 --> 11:28.729
Exactly. It's all just superstition.

11:29.355 --> 11:30.398
Do you still have it?

11:31.399 --> 11:33.609
Give it here. I'll throw it out for you.

11:35.945 --> 11:36.862
It should be burned.

11:39.281 --> 11:40.950
What did Doona's say?

11:41.033 --> 11:43.452
- For God's sake!
- What was that?

11:43.536 --> 11:46.872
I spent all that damned money
for you to learn Korean,

11:46.956 --> 11:48.165
and you cheat on me?

11:50.668 --> 11:52.503
That's fucking mine!

11:52.586 --> 11:54.630
I told you to learn how to communicate,

11:55.214 --> 11:57.466
not to communicate with some bitch.

11:57.550 --> 11:58.467
Some bitch?

11:59.218 --> 12:02.430
Why are you angry?
I told you she's just a friend!

12:02.513 --> 12:04.306
A friend? You crazy bastard.

12:04.390 --> 12:06.726
Do you hang out with your friends
in your underwear?

12:10.104 --> 12:11.814
Dos Santos!

12:13.899 --> 12:15.735
Fuck you, you son of a bitch!

12:15.818 --> 12:17.111
Fuck you!

12:21.991 --> 12:23.159
Thank you.

12:27.455 --> 12:29.206
What is it? Do you know her?

12:29.290 --> 12:30.666
No.

12:31.250 --> 12:33.127
I think I mistook her for someone else.

12:36.255 --> 12:37.089
The fortune.

12:41.427 --> 12:42.970
- Let's go.
- Yup.

12:50.728 --> 12:51.854
Jin-ju!

12:53.105 --> 12:53.939
Yes.

13:06.452 --> 13:07.536
What is it?

13:08.496 --> 13:10.456
That bitch of a dorm director!

13:21.592 --> 13:25.012
Hey! Open the door!

13:27.097 --> 13:30.351
Our revered comrade Choi I-ra is
on the top of the penalty points league

13:30.434 --> 13:31.727
for 13 consecutive months!

13:31.811 --> 13:35.147
- You have my respect! A round of applause!
- A round of applause!

13:40.611 --> 13:42.154
PENALTY POINTS FOR MAY
WINNER: CHOI I-RA

13:42.238 --> 13:43.697
WARNING! EVICTION UPON 20 POINTS

13:48.536 --> 13:51.872
I'm being discriminated against
for being a foreigner, plain and simple.

13:52.373 --> 13:54.291
Hey, don't you have a conscience?

13:55.668 --> 13:58.587
You either spend the night elsewhere
or crawl in drunk.

13:58.671 --> 14:02.758
You break the hallway windows
carrying around dress forms for projects.

14:02.842 --> 14:06.720
Do you remember the Pig Samba Festival
she hosted last year?

14:07.429 --> 14:09.098
That was so freaking hilarious.

14:09.181 --> 14:13.143
The fact that you haven't been kicked out
is a discrimination against us.

14:14.395 --> 14:17.731
I broke up with my boyfriend,
so I won't be spending nights elsewhere

14:17.815 --> 14:19.358
or getting drunk anymore.

14:20.317 --> 14:22.611
There'll be no Pig Samba Festival
this year either.

14:22.695 --> 14:23.571
What?

14:24.655 --> 14:27.783
- Have you broken up with Buenos Aires?
- Yes.

14:27.867 --> 14:30.494
For God's sake.
That's the capital of Argentina.

14:30.578 --> 14:32.371
He's Dos Santos.

14:32.454 --> 14:34.123
How did you get into this school?

14:34.707 --> 14:37.334
You're so ignorant.

14:37.418 --> 14:38.586
Bastard.

14:39.712 --> 14:41.130
Get out of my life.

14:43.549 --> 14:44.633
Go die somewhere.

14:50.014 --> 14:50.973
Is it for real?

14:55.519 --> 14:56.687
Well,

14:56.770 --> 15:00.399
you know the group blind date
this weekend? Should we take I-ra too?

15:00.482 --> 15:01.734
Wasn't it 2 boys, 2 girls?

15:01.817 --> 15:04.320
Son of a…

15:05.738 --> 15:07.865
We'll just tell them to bring another guy.

15:21.879 --> 15:26.008
Won-jun, was the goddess
in the lecture hall the real Doona?

15:26.091 --> 15:27.301
Doona from Dream Sweet?

15:27.384 --> 15:30.596
Check out the link Seong-guk posted
on the department group chat.

15:34.141 --> 15:35.684
DREAM SWEET'S EX-LEAD-SINGER DOONA

15:38.354 --> 15:41.106
A female idol eating jajangmyeon
at that time of night. Unbelievable!

15:41.190 --> 15:42.775
What a freaking cushy life she has.

15:42.858 --> 15:45.069
Dream Sweet is falling apart
since Doona's exit.

15:45.152 --> 15:47.529
Is he just a regular guy?
Pay more taxes, you jerk.

15:47.613 --> 15:50.491
- Fuck, I hope this was photoshopped.
- Doona still has fans left?

15:50.574 --> 15:51.575
She's famously rude.

15:51.659 --> 15:54.119
There's only a handful of them left.
The loud minority.

15:54.203 --> 15:56.872
She wants an average life
but not the average bank account.

15:56.956 --> 16:01.210
Agree. She rakes in all she can
then runs off when it suits her.

16:01.293 --> 16:05.172
Dream Sweet hasn't been able to release
a single studio album since she left.

16:05.255 --> 16:07.299
- What a dick move.
- Who are the other members?

16:07.383 --> 16:09.134
- Has she retired from showbiz?
- Nope.

16:09.218 --> 16:10.386
For fuck's sake.

16:10.469 --> 16:13.013
I'm sure she'll be back
once the money runs out.

16:14.890 --> 16:16.976
LOOK AT HER LIVING A NORMAL LIFE
UNBELIEVABLE

16:31.949 --> 16:32.825
It's hot.

16:39.915 --> 16:41.291
The photo looks good.

16:41.959 --> 16:43.961
It's like a scene
out of a Hong Kong movie.

16:45.212 --> 16:46.296
Are you all right?

16:47.172 --> 16:48.507
Isn't it fascinating?

16:49.008 --> 16:50.759
We were the only customers.

16:52.302 --> 16:53.303
Did the staff take it?

16:58.267 --> 16:59.643
What's with the sad look?

17:02.312 --> 17:04.231
Did you get doxxed or something?

17:05.441 --> 17:07.234
No, it's not because of me, but…

17:08.527 --> 17:10.487
People are talking about you like…

17:12.865 --> 17:13.741
What?

17:15.034 --> 17:16.118
They're trashing me?

17:18.078 --> 17:19.705
They're so brutal.

17:22.875 --> 17:24.877
You've never looked me up online,
have you?

17:26.712 --> 17:28.380
I'm known for being a dumpster.

17:30.883 --> 17:32.176
I'm someone

17:33.886 --> 17:35.471
whom anyone

17:36.597 --> 17:38.307
can say anything about.

17:42.352 --> 17:44.813
I've been told
half my earnings come from my looks

17:44.897 --> 17:46.690
and the other half for the abuse I get.

17:47.858 --> 17:49.276
Luckily, I'm worth quite a lot.

17:50.778 --> 17:52.780
At least that makes it worthwhile.

17:54.031 --> 17:55.699
Who told you that?

17:55.783 --> 17:58.827
Jesus, there are some assholes
in the world.

18:01.622 --> 18:02.790
Oh, that's right!

18:03.332 --> 18:04.541
You're hot when you swear.

18:05.125 --> 18:05.959
What?

18:06.043 --> 18:06.919
Try swearing at me.

18:07.419 --> 18:09.213
- Swear at me!
- God, what even…

18:09.922 --> 18:12.299
You never take anything seriously.

18:14.635 --> 18:16.386
Anyway, I'm glad you're okay.

18:16.470 --> 18:17.596
I'll see you later.

18:32.069 --> 18:33.070
Hey,

18:33.946 --> 18:36.865
if you have to do
one of those public address speeches

18:36.949 --> 18:39.326
or hold a press conference or something…

18:40.911 --> 18:41.829
Yes?

18:43.872 --> 18:45.040
I'll come with you.

18:46.834 --> 18:48.210
To say what?

18:49.294 --> 18:50.462
That we're just friends.

18:59.346 --> 19:01.765
Can't you tell them
I'm someone you have feelings for?

19:07.229 --> 19:08.814
Can't you do that?

19:10.607 --> 19:12.151
Oh, for God's sake…

19:16.405 --> 19:17.573
Hey, wait for me!

19:19.074 --> 19:21.827
Hey, wait for me! Hey!

19:23.662 --> 19:25.873
- Be honest. Did It make your heart pound?
- No.

19:25.956 --> 19:28.333
- That's not what your pupils said.
- Nope.

19:29.543 --> 19:31.503
What will you wear
to the press conference?

19:32.504 --> 19:33.338
Hanbok.

19:35.340 --> 19:36.675
- Really?
- Yes.

19:36.758 --> 19:38.927
Who wears hanbok to a press conference?

19:47.936 --> 19:49.646
TIME TO MOVE ON FROM
YOUR PAST RELATIONSHIP AND START ANEW!

19:49.730 --> 19:50.981
SEIZE EVERY OPPORTUNITY
TO CHANGE YOUR FATE

20:03.035 --> 20:04.077
Dinner.

20:04.161 --> 20:05.704
Okay, thanks.

20:11.710 --> 20:13.921
Do you girls use social media too?

20:14.004 --> 20:16.924
I have an account,
but I'm not very active on it.

20:17.007 --> 20:19.092
Don't use it. Delete your account.

20:21.178 --> 20:22.012
Yes, sir.

20:27.601 --> 20:29.728
WOULD YOU LIKE TO DEACTIVATE
RATHER THAN DELETE?

20:30.562 --> 20:34.191
RECENT SIGHTING OF LEE DOONA EATING
WITH A MAN IN THE MIDDLE OF THE NIGHT

20:34.274 --> 20:35.817
IS SHE CRAZY?

21:20.237 --> 21:21.321
The weather

21:22.948 --> 21:24.199
is freaking amazing.

21:41.008 --> 21:43.552
YOU WILL FACE YOUR ENEMY
AT THE WORST MOMENT

21:44.928 --> 21:46.847
What? What is this?

21:46.930 --> 21:48.765
I'm sure I gave this to Jin-ju.

21:49.891 --> 21:51.852
God, this is so creepy.

21:58.984 --> 22:01.194
This is not happening. Knock on wood!

22:03.989 --> 22:04.823
Knock on wood!

22:24.384 --> 22:25.594
What are you up to?

22:27.512 --> 22:28.930
Are you going somewhere?

22:29.681 --> 22:30.515
Me?

22:31.933 --> 22:32.934
Going on a date.

22:35.437 --> 22:36.646
With who?

22:37.606 --> 22:38.440
With you.

22:40.567 --> 22:41.401
What?

22:42.069 --> 22:44.571
Can't you see the weather is nice?
What should we do?

22:47.324 --> 22:48.867
I've got my finals coming up.

22:50.744 --> 22:53.789
Look here. Stop being so annoying
when my makeup looks so good.

22:53.872 --> 22:54.915
Look.

22:54.998 --> 22:57.584
Look at that perfect eyeliner.
Do you think this is easy?

22:58.919 --> 23:00.629
It's way harder than this.

23:02.672 --> 23:03.548
What will you wear?

23:10.806 --> 23:11.723
How about this?

23:12.349 --> 23:14.518
Oh, that reminds me. Take some clothes.

23:14.601 --> 23:15.936
After that last incident,

23:16.019 --> 23:18.146
might be good to keep
some men's clothes around.

23:20.023 --> 23:23.235
Something like this? And this.

23:25.904 --> 23:26.822
One second.

23:28.156 --> 23:29.074
Hi, Yun-taek.

23:29.157 --> 23:31.785
Hey, Won-jun, you've got to help me out.

23:31.868 --> 23:33.078
What's going on?

23:33.578 --> 23:36.790
You'll know when you get here.
Can you just come? Please come, okay?

23:37.290 --> 23:38.291
Won-jun, listen to me.

23:38.375 --> 23:40.710
It's a matter of life and death.

23:41.545 --> 23:43.088
I'll send you the address.

23:45.257 --> 23:46.383
What the?

23:46.466 --> 23:48.635
Hello?

23:49.261 --> 23:50.429
What's going on?

23:51.138 --> 23:54.307
I have to go. Yun-taek says it's urgent.

23:54.391 --> 23:55.976
Can't you just ditch him?

23:56.059 --> 23:58.645
You can just close the door
behind you on your way out.

23:59.771 --> 24:00.897
I'll see you later.

24:13.118 --> 24:14.494
- Anyone?
- No.

24:18.165 --> 24:19.291
Won-jun!

24:20.542 --> 24:21.376
Yun-taek!

24:23.920 --> 24:26.173
- Did you see him?
- I saw potential.

24:26.256 --> 24:28.091
- He looks good from behind.
- Let's go.

24:28.800 --> 24:31.178
Are you okay?
I thought something happened to you.

24:31.261 --> 24:32.095
No!

24:32.179 --> 24:34.264
Everything's fine. It's all good now.

24:34.347 --> 24:35.557
Oh! Hey.

24:42.647 --> 24:43.482
Cute.

24:44.149 --> 24:46.776
- Cute.
- Hella cute.

25:03.043 --> 25:04.628
Sorry about the holdup.

25:05.337 --> 25:06.296
Don't worry about it.

25:13.094 --> 25:17.641
I'd forgotten for way too long
that I did, in fact, have an enemy.

25:28.860 --> 25:32.280
My belly! I'm dying!

25:32.364 --> 25:34.449
SURGERY IN PROGRESS

25:38.620 --> 25:41.665
That was the beginning of the tragedy.

25:42.916 --> 25:43.833
Shall we?

25:44.501 --> 25:47.546
Let's have them marry each other
so we can be in-laws.

25:48.171 --> 25:50.215
That would be wonderful!

25:50.298 --> 25:51.132
Yeah.

26:04.020 --> 26:05.689
Stop it!

26:05.772 --> 26:07.691
I said stop it!

26:07.774 --> 26:09.317
Call me Noona!

26:10.110 --> 26:11.319
Say it!

26:16.908 --> 26:19.286
Hey, have a bite of this.

26:19.995 --> 26:22.289
I don't want to. Look--

26:23.957 --> 26:25.750
I told you I didn't want any!

26:25.834 --> 26:28.628
How dare you speak to me like that?
Call me Noona.

26:29.337 --> 26:30.463
Whatever.

26:30.547 --> 26:31.798
Here. Try it.

26:44.686 --> 26:48.940
Won-jun, my future husband,
save yourself for me until we meet again.

26:49.441 --> 26:52.652
If you cheat on me, I'll curse you
and your descendants. Got it?

26:53.153 --> 26:55.697
I will return. I will be bag.

27:03.330 --> 27:04.706
Lee Won-jun!

27:19.220 --> 27:21.598
At the age of 12,
Choi I-ra emigrated to Brazil,

27:21.681 --> 27:26.227
leaving me with a thousand paper cranes,
a curse, and a resolution to become a bag.

27:26.811 --> 27:29.147
And that is when I finally started
to grow taller.

27:29.230 --> 27:30.565
- More!
- Just a little!

27:30.649 --> 27:34.694
- You really don't know me?
- No, this is the first time we've met.

27:35.487 --> 27:37.989
And Yangjin Birthcare Center
doesn't ring a bell either?

27:38.073 --> 27:38.990
No, it doesn't.

27:39.741 --> 27:41.534
How about Dingdongdang Piano Academy?

27:41.618 --> 27:42.452
No.

27:43.870 --> 27:45.080
I see!

27:46.206 --> 27:47.332
I wonder why?

28:48.977 --> 28:49.894
- Love shot!
- Come on.

28:49.978 --> 28:52.981
You're very quiet, Mr. First Time!

28:53.732 --> 28:56.484
This will be the first
and last time we see each other.

28:57.193 --> 28:58.027
Right.

29:05.952 --> 29:06.786
Everyone take one!

29:14.711 --> 29:16.212
- Number one…
- Who's number one?

29:16.296 --> 29:17.505
Who's number one?

29:20.133 --> 29:23.636
- It's Choi I-ra.
- Number one takes number four's face…

29:23.720 --> 29:25.638
- Number four.
- Who's number four?

29:27.724 --> 29:31.227
Takes number four's face
and caresses it while…

29:31.311 --> 29:34.189
- Make it hot!
- Make it hot!

29:34.272 --> 29:35.690
…kissing him!

29:36.274 --> 29:41.696
- Kiss!
- Kiss!

29:41.780 --> 29:42.822
All right.

29:43.364 --> 29:45.909
Let's see how much longer
you keep up this pretense.

29:45.992 --> 29:50.038
- Kiss!
- Kiss!

29:57.962 --> 30:02.467
Kiss!

30:02.550 --> 30:04.135
- Kiss!
- Kiss!

30:13.228 --> 30:14.771
Give it a rest, Choi I-ra.

30:16.689 --> 30:19.150
- This is the penalty drink, right?
- No! Come here!

30:19.234 --> 30:21.736
- Come on.
- Won-jun, reconsider your decision.

30:21.820 --> 30:22.821
You!

30:23.988 --> 30:25.740
You! Don't you dare drink that!

30:45.009 --> 30:46.761
Carrot.

30:46.845 --> 30:47.971
Bunny.

30:48.054 --> 30:50.014
So, you weren't kidnapped, then?

30:53.643 --> 30:56.479
Kidnapped? What do you mean?

30:57.105 --> 30:58.565
I just had a group blind date.

30:59.065 --> 31:00.066
Group blind date?

31:04.445 --> 31:09.367
We had this group blind date,
and Won-jun was sensational tonight.

31:10.785 --> 31:15.290
The kid was all spruced up
unlike his usual self,

31:15.373 --> 31:16.833
and the girls' eyes were all

31:16.916 --> 31:19.419
twinkle twinkle like little stars!
Twinkle--

31:20.712 --> 31:21.546
Hey.

31:22.130 --> 31:24.924
- Why hasn't Won-jun come back with you?
- Won-jun?

31:26.801 --> 31:28.720
He hit it off with this freaking sexpot

31:29.220 --> 31:31.055
and left with her.

31:32.849 --> 31:35.935
The looks they were giving each other
were so hot.

31:37.061 --> 31:40.481
Hot and also just freaking hot!

31:42.233 --> 31:45.278
From what I can tell,
Won-jun won't be coming home tonight.

31:45.361 --> 31:46.696
Do you know why?

31:46.779 --> 31:49.782
Because tonight,
that girl is going to just…

31:51.075 --> 31:52.785
You know what I mean, right?

31:53.286 --> 31:55.622
There's no way
he's coming home tonight. No way.

31:56.122 --> 31:57.248
Hey, you know what?

31:57.999 --> 31:59.125
I honestly thought

31:59.626 --> 32:02.545
Won-jun was completely hopeless
when it came to girls.

32:04.005 --> 32:06.090
But he grabbed the girl by her face

32:08.134 --> 32:12.639
and alternated between passionate
and gentle. Passionate and gentle.

32:13.932 --> 32:14.849
He was good.

32:14.933 --> 32:16.684
Yeah, impressive.

32:19.812 --> 32:22.607
What are you doing out here, by the way?
Go in and go to bed.

32:23.107 --> 32:25.360
I'm off to bed myself. Good night.

32:41.709 --> 32:43.044
I'm sorry about this.

32:43.795 --> 32:46.547
I'm sorry.

32:50.593 --> 32:51.678
Hey!

32:54.514 --> 32:56.099
Hey, Choi I-ra!

32:56.849 --> 32:58.726
- What?
- Hey, wake up!

33:01.062 --> 33:01.938
Drink this.

33:08.069 --> 33:09.112
And have this too.

33:20.581 --> 33:24.002
Hey, what the hell were you thinking,
trying to kiss me?

33:24.794 --> 33:26.587
A kiss is hardly a big deal.

33:26.671 --> 33:28.756
In Brazil, it's just a form of greeting.

33:28.840 --> 33:30.091
Well, this is Korea,

33:30.174 --> 33:32.802
a Confucian country
with strict social mores.

33:35.096 --> 33:36.222
That's bullshit!

33:36.305 --> 33:39.058
The way your friends were acting,
I thought we were in Ibiza!

33:40.435 --> 33:41.853
Here's what I want to know.

33:42.353 --> 33:45.481
If you recognized me from the start,
why did you blank me?

33:45.565 --> 33:48.067
Let's just say
I'm averse to you by nature.

33:51.529 --> 33:53.322
- Hey!
- What?

33:57.160 --> 33:59.537
Call me Noona, Won-jun.

33:59.620 --> 34:02.290
See? This is why
I pretended not to recognize you.

34:02.373 --> 34:05.209
If you've sobered up, go home.
Where do you live? Do you live alone?

34:06.044 --> 34:07.336
Sorry to disappoint…

34:09.881 --> 34:11.257
but I live in a dorm.

34:12.383 --> 34:15.595
Hey, cut it out.
Look, I'll walk you there, so let's go.

34:15.678 --> 34:18.014
Did you just say you're walking me home?

34:19.515 --> 34:22.852
You mean I have the privilege
of being escorted by my ex-husband?

34:22.935 --> 34:24.937
Oh, for God's sake!

34:25.021 --> 34:27.732
- What? You know you like it!
- I super don't!

34:27.815 --> 34:29.025
Please!

34:29.650 --> 34:31.986
Can't you just give it a rest?

34:41.037 --> 34:42.288
Hey, what's going on?

34:43.664 --> 34:45.500
Why are you crying all of a sudden?

34:47.960 --> 34:51.547
My boyfriend dumped me.

34:52.381 --> 34:56.219
Dos Santos, the son of a bitch. I…

34:57.136 --> 35:00.014
I was going to get back at him
by meeting someone really hot

35:00.098 --> 35:01.224
at the group blind date.

35:01.307 --> 35:04.894
Why did you have to be there,
of all people?

35:13.528 --> 35:14.654
Why you?

36:51.167 --> 36:53.127
- You're back.
- Yeah.

37:02.428 --> 37:03.763
You're still up.

37:04.639 --> 37:05.473
Yeah.

37:07.808 --> 37:09.435
Why are you out here?

37:10.478 --> 37:11.979
There must be a power outage.

37:13.064 --> 37:14.315
The lights won't turn on.

37:15.483 --> 37:16.484
It was too dark.

37:17.568 --> 37:18.402
Really?

37:22.615 --> 37:24.325
The lights seem to be on upstairs.

37:30.289 --> 37:31.791
What's happened to your hand?

37:33.292 --> 37:34.126
Oh. Yeah.

37:35.294 --> 37:36.796
Burned myself on my cigarette.

37:36.879 --> 37:38.172
Let me have a look.

37:42.843 --> 37:44.345
It must have just happened.

37:44.929 --> 37:45.888
Do you have ice?

37:49.183 --> 37:50.017
In the house.

37:55.606 --> 37:58.734
The fridge is still working,
so it's not a full power outage.

37:58.818 --> 38:01.195
I'll take a look
at the breaker panel for you later.

38:05.908 --> 38:07.285
I hear you had a blind date?

38:08.536 --> 38:09.370
Yes.

38:12.707 --> 38:14.125
What do you do on those things?

38:16.252 --> 38:17.461
The usual stuff.

38:17.962 --> 38:20.172
Drink, pair up,

38:20.756 --> 38:22.258
play childish games.

38:26.429 --> 38:28.055
You smell of alcohol.

38:29.015 --> 38:29.849
Yeah.

38:30.933 --> 38:32.268
I had quite a lot.

38:39.859 --> 38:42.236
You also smell quite strongly
of women's perfume.

38:43.404 --> 38:45.823
I guess. Because I was with a girl.

38:49.744 --> 38:50.828
Give me your hand.

39:07.470 --> 39:08.596
That's weird.

39:09.722 --> 39:11.682
I was fine before…

39:14.977 --> 39:17.980
but why is it more painful
only after you've noticed it?

39:19.357 --> 39:20.900
That's how it goes.

39:22.193 --> 39:24.445
You don't even know you've been hurt,

39:25.321 --> 39:27.156
but as soon as you become aware of it,

39:27.656 --> 39:30.618
it starts stinging and bothering you.

39:36.040 --> 39:37.291
Is that how it goes?

39:37.875 --> 39:39.794
Yes, it's the same for everyone.

39:44.507 --> 39:45.800
Is that why…

39:49.387 --> 39:50.388
I feel this way?

40:49.738 --> 40:51.532
TIME TO MOVE ON FROM
YOUR PAST RELATIONSHIP AND START ANEW!

40:51.615 --> 40:53.242
SEIZE EVERY OPPORTUNITY
TO CHANGE YOUR FATE

43:31.025 --> 43:36.030
Subtitle translation by: Reuben Simpson
